<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA TO DETAIL RESULTS THIS WEEK.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA TO DETAIL RESULTS THIS WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading bank Unibanka said on Tuesday said that it would give a more detailed version of its first-half earnings this week.</p>
<p>The bourse earlier gave the bank's first-half profit as 3.185 million lats, based on figures supplied to the central bank. It also gave details of its assets and liabilities.</p>
<p>But details on the profit breakdown were not given.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Unibanka said that the bank would make its own announcement in the nearest days.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
